{"thread":{"threadID":2917,"boardID":58,"topic":"Adige und der 7 Tage Ban","time":1441197361,"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","lastPostTime":1441385819,"lastPoster":"Cruel OBAMA  NSA REGELT","replies":15,"views":823,"attachments":1,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":36293,"threadID":2917,"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","subject":"Adige und der 7 Tage Ban","time":1441197361,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>ViruzZ hatte angekündigt das adige einen 7 wochen Ct ban bekommt wegen mangelnder kompetenz.<br>Mitlwerweile hatte adige ma spontan die lust auf die ct seite zu gehen bitte Viruzz mach deine drohung wahr.<br>Mfg Senpai</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ps: Bin zublöd zum uploaden der liebe neo übernimmt den screenshot</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36294,"threadID":2917,"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","subject":"","time":1441197410,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[{"attachmentID":650,"objectID":36294,"filename":"2015-09-02_00001.jpg","filesize":323895,"fileType":"image/jpeg","isImage":1,"width":1680,"height":1050,"downloads":76,"uploadTime":1441197405}],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","time":1441197455,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Neon bitte <span class=\"missing-media\">[;)]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36295,"threadID":2917,"userID":1860,"username":"MaikDieENTE","subject":"","time":1441199714,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>danke ... ich will ihn nicht diskriminieren , aber er ist unfähig bzw nervig:)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36296,"threadID":2917,"userID":1903,"username":"dopi","subject":"","time":1441200559,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Am Anfang war es aber schon krass lustig... xD</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36297,"threadID":2917,"userID":1836,"username":"ApicNexie","subject":"","time":1441200596,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1589,"username":"thehashmash","time":1441200746,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich hab immer Spaß wenn er Ct ist, aber ich würde nicht soweit gehen ihn als fähig zu beschreiben.  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36298,"threadID":2917,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1441201805,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>hatte ma vor knapp nem Monat n Gespräch mit Sky über das Thema CT-Ban. Er hat gesagt das wir niemandem CT-Ban geben dürfen/können.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36299,"threadID":2917,"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","subject":"","time":1441203897,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>warum hatt ViruzZ es dann gemacht?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36301,"threadID":2917,"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","subject":"","time":1441204829,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ganz einfach,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Adige ist einer unserer Jüngeren Jail spieler</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>und wurde darauf immer wieder von den Admins hingewiesen die regeln sich &quot;ordentlich&quot;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>durchzulesen was der nicht getan hat.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Deswegen hat ViruzZ ihn als Unfähigen CT eingestuft was völlig gerechtfertigt ist.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Adige macht kaum ansagen, wenn er ansagen macht macht er free frags, und zum teil auch unnötige</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>abschüsse. </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Er hatte den Wochen CT Ban bekommen damit er sich in ruhe die CT und die standard Regeln durchlesen kann.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wir haben nichts gegen Adige, jedoch ist er Immer CT und macht kaum ansagen was viele user stört.</p>\n<p><br></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36304,"threadID":2917,"userID":1657,"username":"ViruszZ","subject":"","time":1441205495,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Was soll ich machen, soll ich ihn bannen wegen Unfähigkeit?<br>Hab ihn ct Verbot geben damit er den ct&#x27;s Zuschauen kann wie es geht und die Regeln durch lesen kann.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich werde noch adige ts3 rufen und mit ihm reden.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mfg<br>ViruszZ</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36306,"threadID":2917,"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","subject":"","time":1441206207,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich finde es ja auch richtig so nur schei9nbar darf man es nicht mit dem Ct Verbot.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36308,"threadID":2917,"userID":1657,"username":"ViruszZ","subject":"","time":1441207734,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Er is noch ein kleines Kind ich fand es halt richtig so obwohl man es nicht darf.<br>Wollte nicht das es zu einen Ban führt</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36313,"threadID":2917,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1441208345,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1872,"username":"idk","time":1441210489,"value":-1},{"userID":1860,"username":"MaikDieENTE","time":1442930298,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>in den Regeln steht doch : keine Diskriminierung wegen des Alters.  Oder?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36314,"threadID":2917,"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","subject":"","time":1441208516,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><em>Ich bezweifele das es als Diskriminierung da stehen soll, sondern eher als eigene Meinung, und ja.</em></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36431,"threadID":2917,"userID":1245,"username":"Cruel OBAMA  NSA REGELT","subject":"","time":1441368737,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wer ist dieser Adige ?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36435,"threadID":2917,"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","subject":"","time":1441371252,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1860,"username":"MaikDieENTE","time":1442930315,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ein ziemlich Junger mitspieler den eigentlich keiner mag (nohate) und einfach nur rumsingt/keinCtkann</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36445,"threadID":2917,"userID":1245,"username":"Cruel OBAMA  NSA REGELT","subject":"","time":1441385819,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Alles klar.</p>","polls":[]}]}